  "diagnosis": {
    "accessibility": "Existing live and isInteractive conjuncts wrongly require a child-local property to be true even while its real ancestor suppresses all contained accessibility elements. Correction must require actual child ancestry plus that ancestor property and preserve raw native diagnostics.",
    "layout": "No priority design makes the stage own surplus vertical space. The fully constrained cover label contributes intrinsic sizing; original status label stretches while stage settles at 26.333 points. A low vertical cover-hugging priority and higher chrome priorities target this specific competition while preserving required constraints.",
